 ## Background
-The method originates from research on scalable web-based volume rendering of large biomedical datasets [S1, unofficial]. It is part of a mixed-resolution multi-volume rendering system that uses a residency octree to manage cache efficiency [S1, unofficial]. The approach was developed to handle the complexity of rendering large datasets with varying resolution levels efficiently [S1, unofficial].
